"eEn":"The nine 雇 birds: birds that mark the seasons for farming and sericulture, restraining the people from excess. Formed from 隹, with 戶 indicating the pronunciation. The spring 雇 is 鳻盾; the summer 雇, 竊玄; the autumn 雇, 竊藍; the winter 雇, 竊黃; the thorn 雇, 竊丹; the traveling 雇, 唶唶; the night 雇, 嘖嘖; the mulberry 雇, 竊脂; and the old 雇 is the quail.",
