"2480":{
"id":"2480",
"head":"焉",
"e":"焉鳥，黃色，出於江淮。象形。凡字：朋者，羽蟲之屬；烏者，日中之禽；舄者，知太歲之所在；燕者，請子之𠋫，作巢避戊己。所䝿者故皆象形。焉亦是也。",
"p":"yān",
"r":"烏",
"v":"04",
"w":"",
"variants":[],
"indexes":[
"焉"
],
"rid":"sw:2478",
"eEn":"The 焉 bird is yellow and comes from the Yangtze and Huai River region. A pictograph. Among characters, 朋 represents the feathered creatures; 烏 represents the bird within the sun; 舄 represents the bird that knows the whereabouts of Tai Sui; and 燕 represents the bird that signals the time to seek offspring and avoids the directions associated with 戊 and 己 when building its nest. Because these creatures are esteemed, their characters are all pictographs. 焉 is likewise a pictograph.",
"translationStatus":"retained-exact"
},
