"5786":{
"id":"5786",
"head":"包",
"e":"象人褢妊，巳在中，象子未成形也。元气起於子。子，人所生也。男左行三十，女右行二十，俱立於巳，爲夫婦。褢妊於巳，巳爲子，十月而生。男起巳至寅，女起巳至申。故男秊始寅，女秊始申也。凡包之屬皆从包。",
"p":"bāo",
"r":"包",
"v":"09",
"w":"",
"variants":[],
"indexes":[
"包"
],
"rid":"sw:5786",
"eEn":"It depicts a pregnant person, with 巳 inside representing a child whose form is not yet complete. Primal vital energy arises at 子. A child, 子, is what a human being gives birth to. The male proceeds leftward through thirty, and the female rightward through twenty; both stand at 巳 and become husband and wife. Pregnancy begins at 巳; 巳 represents the child, which is born after ten months. The male starts from 巳 and reaches 寅; the female starts from 巳 and reaches 申. Thus the male's years begin at 寅, and the female's years begin at 申. All characters in the 包 class are formed with 包.",
"translationStatus":"retained-exact"
},
