"eEn":"A flag erected in a district or village. It depicts its pole and has three streamers. It is made of mixed silks, with the two halves of each breadth differing. It is used to urge the people onward; hence haste is called 勿勿. All characters in the 勿 class are formed with 勿.",
"translationStatus":"retained-exact"
