"eEn":"An adult man. Formed from 大, with 一 depicting a hairpin. Under the Zhou system, eight inches made one foot, and ten feet made one 丈. A person was eight feet tall, hence the designation 丈夫. All characters in the 夫 class are formed with 夫.",
