"eEn":"The eight winds: from the east, Mingshu; southeast, Qingming; south, Jing; southwest, Liang; west, Changhe; northwest, Buzhou; north, Guangmo; and northeast, Rong. The entry says that when wind stirs, creatures arise, and that creatures therefore transform in eight days. Formed from 虫, with 凡 indicating the pronunciation. All characters in the 風 class are formed with 風.",
"translationStatus":"retained-exact"
